==Trivia==
* In the English-language dub of ''[[AG097|Gaining Groudon]]'', Tabitha directly addresses one Magma grunt as '''Derrick'''. This makes him one of the very few villainous team grunts in the franchise to have a confirmed name.
* In [[Pokémon Black and White Versions 2|Pokémon Black 2 and White 2]], a former Magma Grunt can be found in [[Icirrus City]] during winter, appearing as a {{tc|Roughneck}}. He is in a relationship with a former female Aqua Grunt and neither seems to know the other's previous affiliation.
** In [[Pokémon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire]], there is a former Magma Grunt with a former Aqua Grunt hiding in the Battle Resort, afraid that their respective teams will disapprove. Whether they are the same couple in Pokémon Black 2 and White 2 is unknown, due to the couple's awareness of each other's past.

